{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.BorromeanTraceConventionSplit","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.BorromeanTraceConventionSplit","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Rat","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.BorromeanMarkovTrace"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.conventionD_ne_conventionC","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.conventionD_ne_conventionC","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L146-L154","doc":"**Convention D ≠ convention C.** The pipeline (TL/Jones) trace and the\ncanonical (Wenzl z-trace) Markov trace of `β_Bor` are NOT the same\nfunction of `t = √q`: they differ at `t = 2` (where both denominators\nare nonzero), hence differ as rational functions. The trace-convention\nsplit registered in the 2026-06-09 audit addendum is a theorem. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.conventionD_ne_conventionC_at_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.conventionD_ne_conventionC_at_two","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L137-L144","doc":"**The split witness point.** At `t = 2` the two conventions give\ndifferent exact rationals: `tr_C(2) = −236413/512` while\n`tr_D(2) = −13746641/73984`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_t_eq_trM_borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_t_eq_trM_borromean","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L118-L135","doc":"**Bridge to the corpus closed form.** For `t ≠ 0`, the t-form of\nconvention D equals `trM_borromean (t² − t⁻²)` — the Lean-proved\n`BorromeanMarkovTrace` quotient form at `h = q − q⁻¹ = t² − t⁻²`.\nSo `trD_borromean` here IS the corpus pipeline object, re-parameterised. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean_den_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean_den_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L111-L116","doc":"The D-denominator `t⁸(t⁴+1)²` is nonzero for `t ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trC_borromean_den_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trC_borromean_den_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L105-L109","doc":"The C-denominator `t⁹` is nonzero for `t ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L100-L103","doc":"Convention D (TL/Jones pipeline) at `β_Bor`, quotient form over `ℚ`\nin `t = √q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trC_borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trC_borromean","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L95-L98","doc":"Convention C (canonical Jones–Markov / Wenzl z-trace) at `β_Bor`,\nquotient form over `ℚ` in `t = √q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean_den_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean_den_factor","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L84-L88","doc":"The D-denominator factors as `t⁸·(t⁴+1)²` — pure `ring`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean_den","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean_den","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L81-L82","doc":"Denominator of convention D in `t`: `t¹⁶ + 2t¹² + t⁸ = t⁸(t⁴+1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean_num","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trD_borromean_num","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L75-L79","doc":"Numerator of the pipeline (convention D / TL-Jones) trace of `β_Bor`\nin `t = √q`: the `trM_borromean_num (t² − t⁻²)` numerator after clearing\n`t`-powers. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trC_borromean_den","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trC_borromean_den","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L72-L73","doc":"Denominator of convention C at `β_Bor`: `t⁹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trC_borromean_num","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.trC_borromean_num","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/BorromeanTraceConventionSplit.lean#L65-L70","doc":"Numerator of the canonical (convention C / Wenzl z-trace) Markov trace\nof `β_Bor`, as a polynomial in `t = √q`. CAS-derived by three agreeing\nroutes (see file header provenance). ","signatureChunk":0}]}